<title>RUSSIA: Chelyabenergo 97 Q1 IAS net up to 365 bln rbls.</title>
<headline>Chelyabenergo 97 Q1 IAS net up to 365 bln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ending March 31</p>
<p> (bln rbls)		     1997			    1996</p>
<p> Net sales		    1,943.2			 1,673.9</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 410.2			   288.9</p>
<p> Net profit		     365.2			   235.7</p>
<p>NOTES -- Company's full name AO Elektrifikatsii Chelyabenergo.</p>
<p>Figures prepared to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>National power company UES owns 58 percent of Chelyabenergo and the Chelyabinsk region property fund owns a further 15.7 percent.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
